<title>SOUTH AFRICA: INDEPENDENT NEWSPAPERS YEAR EPS RISES.</title>
<headline>INDEPENDENT NEWSPAPERS YEAR EPS RISES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     167.8	 vs 134.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 90.0	  vs 60.0 </p>
<p>    Attrib income	   76.68	 vs 60.77</p>
