<p>    Tax			 46.52	 vs 32.24</p>
<p>    Net interest received 0.43	  vs 4.50 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  991.98	vs 872.24   </p>
<p>Full name: Independent Newspapers Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Media group Independent Newspapers said in a</p>
<p>statement that its major products are well positioned to produce</p>
<p>further growth and -- given no unexpected deterioration in</p>
<p>economic trends -- group earnings for 1997 are expected to show</p>
<p>further good growth.</p>
